# Citation metadata for EigenTrace (https://citation-file-format.github.io/)
# Code is MIT-licensed (LICENSE). The measurements dataset built by
# dataset/build_dataset.py is CC BY 4.0 (dataset/LICENSE-DATA); see the
# preferred-citation block below for the dataset record.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EigenTrace or its measurements dataset, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: EigenTrace
abstract: >-
  EigenTrace asks five commercial language models (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini,
  DeepSeek, Grok) to summarize the same live news stories and measures what
  they omit and where they diverge: per-model VIX and consensus density over
  BAAI/bge-large-en-v1.5 embeddings, absent-word ratios, void and logos words,
  killshot claims, and lexical compression scores.
authors:
  - family-names: Adams
    given-names: Sean
repository-code: https://github.com/sdad1018/Eigentrace
url: https://github.com/sdad1018/Eigentrace
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-10"
keywords:
  - large language models
  - news summarization
  - omission
  - model divergence
  - embedding geometry
identifiers:
  # OWNER: replace TODO with the DOI Zenodo assigns after the upload
  # (dataset/README.md, section "Zenodo steps"), then update the same DOI
  # in dataset/README.md.
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.TODO
    description: Zenodo record of the EigenTrace measurements dataset v1
